       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SHRMAIN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO MAINDD
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  OUT-FILE RECORDING MODE IS F.
       01  OUT-REC  PIC X(80).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN OUTPUT OUT-FILE.
           MOVE 'WRITTEN BY THE MAIN PROGRAM' TO OUT-REC.
           WRITE OUT-REC.
           CLOSE OUT-FILE.
           CALL 'SHRSUB'.
           GOBACK.
